<th id="S3.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">No-context</th>
<td id="S3.T2.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">0.57</td>
